ignates one player and falsifies whatever that player is about to learn. The result comes back reversed: No claim can ever be certain, which turns every round into an argument about how much to trust what someone says.", "themes": [{"id": 17, "name": "Fantasy"}, {"id": 40, "name": "Party"}, {"id": 43, "name": "Mystery"}], "url": "https://www.igdb.com/games/lycanthropia"}